  ;; the same concept as concerned_years above, MISSPELLED and differently
  ;; typed, and because it spelled out every available option while the live
  ;; field states three, it was the most complete example in this file - so the
  ;; next person adding a field was more likely to copy the dead wrong one
  ;; precisely because it looked more thorough.
  ]}
